  "releaseNotes": "This version based on commit https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/commit/198c3ef033f63b9e5adff8f48540d782439b0d18\n\nAdd some missing control themes (SplitButton, DropDownButton, ManagedFileChooser), correct FlyoutPresenter (#455)\n\n* Add SplitButton support and some demo\n\n* Add DropDownButton themes (Raised and Outline var.)\n\n* Copy a ManagedFileChooser from official Avalonia Fluent theme\n\n* Correct some behaviour of SplitButton, use Name instead of x:Name\n\n* Add new themes to the Index (DropDownButton, ManagedFileChooser)\n\n* Update demo (Buttons and Dialog section)\n\n* Fix: FlyoutPresenter had no background brush\n\n* Update demo (Buttons)\n\n* Remove non-meaning comments (PR#455)",
